{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102107","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102107/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102107/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102107/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102107","id":2814520836,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6nwi4E","number":102107,"title":"Rigidbody3d:_on_sleeping_state_change does not work when the rigidbody is instantiated, bug on godot 4.4 beta1","user":{"login":"ayt4797","id":54717651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzE3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54717651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayt4797","html_url":"https://github.com/ayt4797","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayt4797/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayt4797/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayt4797/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayt4797/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayt4797/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayt4797/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayt4797/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayt4797/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayt4797/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-01-28T03:09:41Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T14:59:10Z","closed_at":"2025-02-12T14:56:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in 4.4 beta1, \n\n### System information\n\nLinux-Mint (6.8), 4.4.1, amd5600xt, intel 12th gen\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you instantiate a rigidbody3d which has a script _on_sleeping_state_changed() the instated object _on_sleeping_state_changed() function will never fire. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a parent node, with a rigibody-child scene. On that child box give it a script that makes a call to _on_sleeping_state_changed(), I have it so that on _ready it gets a apply_central_impulse(throw_vector * 1). Have the parent scene node instantiate the rigidbody child scene. You will see that both the childs do get the impulse and in the inspector both will have their sleep checkbox go off and on, but only the non-instntaited node will have it's _on_sleeping_change function get triggered. \n\nI've attached  a video of me doing this test\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c549f5d-df1f-4bc5-b672-03f486dfe99a\n\nTo stress because, It kind of looks like I clicked the checkbox, I did not I let the objects inertia slow it down until it stopped.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nGodot4.4.1 just the standard assets was able to recreate this issue\n\n[test_sleeping_instation_project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18594883/test_sleeping_instation_project.zip)\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102107/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102107/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}